Derpseek: notices

Derpseek's own code, scripts, profiles, rowmaps and documentation are MIT licensed (LICENSE), copyright 2026 chronarion.

It runs on top of the dsv41 engine (https://github.com/chronarion/dsv41, MIT) and carries modified copies of these
files; each says at its top that it was modified for Derpseek:

- engine/overlay/megamoe_fork/: two headers of DeepGEMM (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM, MIT,
  engine/overlay/megamoe_fork/LICENSE.DeepGEMM) as forked by ds41 (MIT, engine/LICENSE.ds41) and vendored by dsv41.
- engine/overlay/fastpath_boundary.py: a ds41 fastpath component (MIT, engine/LICENSE.ds41).
- engine/hook/mega_peer_hook.py: ds41's MegaMoE peer hook (MIT, engine/LICENSE.ds41), which comes from
  original-el8's dgx-station-gb300-research (Apache-2.0, engine/hook/LICENSE; snapshot commit in engine/hook/SOURCE).

The engine also uses vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm, Apache-2.0) at run time; it is not redistributed here.
